  "description": "No fix commit exists or is needed — tag v1.0.725 (commit c0a4304) is the same commit schedule run 43585188751 validated fully green. The red run 43586792697 was remediated per the gh-2124 precedent: full re-run (attempt 2) completed success at 12:13Z — all 65 jobs green (Core tests shard 0/4, PTY/CLI shard 2/3, Quality gate, Publish to pub.dev, Sign release checksums, Advance vpinned marker); release v1.0.725 published 12:10:16Z with SHA256SUMS, PINNED_VERSION advanced to v1.0.725 at 12:10:40Z, pub.dev serves the package (HTTP 200). The ref is green — ticket close condition satisfied.",
  "verification_test": "test/task/subagent_registry_caps_test.dart (failed-to-load suite; 6/6 PASSED locally on c0a4304) + full PTY shard-2 target list with CI flags (dart test --tags integration --exclude-tags browser-ext,llm --concurrency=4, 27 files) — PASSED locally including the three tests in-flight at the wedge (tui_prototype_snapshot, shell_job_countdown_pty, ssh_shift_gate); the single local red (trajectory/perf_open_gate_test.dart, 9030ms vs 9000ms budget) was sandbox load noise and passes standalone at 6443ms."
}

