    },
    "continuation": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "The token a previous capped call returned — resumes the scan after the records already examined."
    }
  }
}

arguments.content:
{
  "commit": "c0a4304",
  "rca": "Transient suite-isolate death on the ubuntu-24.04-arm runner (hostile-ambient class, issue #965 / gh-2124 precedent): core shard 0 lost one suite at load ('Connection closed before full header was received' on test/task/subagent_registry_caps_test.dart) and PTY/CLI shard 2/3 lost a suite's vm-service connection at suite close ('Service connection disposed' during coverage gather), whose unhandled exception wedged the package:test engine until the 40-min job cap — not a product defect: the same commit ran the identical legs green 20 minutes earlier (run 43585188751), reproduces green locally, and the full re-run (attempt 2) went green with zero code changes.",
  "description": "No fix commit exists or is needed — tag v1.0.725 (commit c0a4304) is the same commit schedule run 43585188751 validated fully green. The red run 43586792697 was remediated per the gh-2124 precedent: full re-run (attempt 2) completed success at 12:13Z — all 65 jobs green (Core tests shard 0/4, PTY/CLI shard 2/3, Quality gate, Publish to pub.dev, Sign release checksums, Advance vpinned marker); release v1.0.725 published 12:10:16Z with SHA256SUMS, PINNED_VERSION advanced to v1.0.725 at 12:10:40Z, pub.dev serves the package (HTTP 200). The ref is green — ticket close condition satisfied (re-verified live on every leg re-run, including after main advanced to b8a61a7 (gh-2178/PR #2180)). The release pipeline has kept flowing since: PINNED_VERSION now reads v1.0.727, release v1.0.727 published 19:15:42Z and is Latest (v1.0.726 has no published release object — a later cycle's concern, not this ticket's).",
  "verification_test": "test/task/subagent_registry_caps_test.dart (failed-to-load suite; 6/6 PASSED locally on c0a4304; file re-confirmed present in the b8a61a7 tree) + full PTY shard-2 target list with CI flags (dart test --tags integration --exclude-tags browser-ext,llm --concurrency=4, 27 files) — PASSED locally including the three tests in-flight at the wedge (tui_prototype_snapshot, shell_job_countdown_pty, ssh_shift_gate); the single local red (trajectory/perf_open_gate_test.dart, 9030ms vs 9000ms budget) was sandbox load noise and passes standalone at 6443ms."
}

